        "liquid": "<style>\n  .custom-columns {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .custom-columns > div {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 10px;\n  }\n  .bullet-points {\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .bullet-points li {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .bullet-points li::before {\n    content: \"\\2022\"; /* Unicode for bullet point */\n    margin-right: 10px;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .custom-columns {\n      flex-direction: column;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"custom-columns\">\n  <div>\n    <h2>Payment by</h2>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/icons8-visa-100.svg?v=1720097038\"> \n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/icons8-mastercard-100.svg?v=1720097044\"> \n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/icons8-american-express-100.svg?v=1720097048\"><br><br>\n    <b>Cards accepted:</b><br><br>\n    Visa, Mastercard, American Express<br><br>\n    Payment by credit/debit card is 100% secure, and no information from your card is sent to us.<br><br>\n    To better protect our customers when making online payments, you may be presented with 3D secure security measures when paying. This depends on your bank issuer and may require you to enter a password or get a security code via email or phone.\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <h2>Payment by</h2>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/icons8-apple-pay-100.svg?v=1720097703\"><br><br>\n    Apple Pay is available on compatible devices (iOS devices like iPad, iPhone, and Mac) using the Safari browser.<br><br>\n    All orders under €2000 are eligible. If your device supports Apple Pay, this option will appear at checkout.\n  </div>\n  <div>\n    <h2>Payment by</h2><br>\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0780/3843/files/icons8-paypal_2.svg?v=1720104286\"><br><br>\n    <b>If you have a PayPal account</b><br>\n    <ul class=\"bullet-points\">\n      <li>Choose the PayPal option on the payment page when placing your order</li>\n      <li>You'll be redirected to your PayPal account</li>\n      <li>Login and validate your payment</li>\n      <li>Once your payment is validated, you'll be automatically redirected to williamwoodmirrors.co.uk to complete your order.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <b>If you don't have a PayPal account</b><br>\n    <ul class=\"bullet-points\">\n\n    <ul class=\"bullet-points\">\n      <li>Navigate to the Paypal website and create a Paypal account</li>\n      <li>Return to the William Wood website and follow the steps above now that you have an account</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
