        "liquid": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Responsive Alignment</title>\n    <style>\n        .responsive-text {\n            text-align: left; /* Default to left align for mobile */\n        }\n\n        .responsive-img {\n            display: block;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 768px) {\n            .responsive-text {\n                text-align: center; /* Center align for desktop and larger screens */\n            }\n\n            .responsive-img {\n                margin: 0 auto; /* Center the image on larger screens */\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"responsive-text\">\n        <h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.1px;\">Payment by</h2>\n        <img src=\"https://x.klarnacdn.net/payment-method/assets/badges/generic/white/klarna.svg\" class=\"responsive-img\" style=\"width: 150px; margin-bottom: 0.1px;\">\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n<br>\n<div class=\"two-columns\">\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <b>Pay later in 30 days</b><br><br>\n    You can choose to pay up to 30 days after your order has been shipped - no fees when you pay on time. Upon your purchase with Pay in 30 days you will receive an invoice from Klarna by email, stating when payment is due.<br><br>\n\n    Your payment will be paid directly to Klarna and you will get a reminder before the due date. You also have the possibility to pay your balance before the 30 day deadline through the Klarna App.<br><br>\n\n    <u><a href=\"https://cdn.klarna.com/1.0/shared/content/legal/terms/0/en-GB/payin30bycard\">Read Terms and conditions</a></u><br><br>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <b>Pay in 3 instalments</b><br><br>\n    You can choose to pay in 3 instalments - no fees when you pay on time.<br><br>\n\n    This will split the cost of your order over three equal monthly instalments. The first payment will be debited by William Wood when your order has dispatched from our warehouse.<br><br>\n\n    Your second payment will be collected 30 days thereafter and your third and final payment will be collected 60 days after the initial payment.<br><br>\n\n    <u><a href=\"https://cdn.klarna.com/1.0/shared/content/legal/terms/0/en-GB/payin30bycard\">Read Terms and conditions</a></u><br><br>\n  </div>\n</div>",
