</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"cwp_small_icon_grid db-credit-py-4\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-container\">\n<h2 class=\"db-credit-mb-5 db-credit-text-center\">Spread the Cost, Interest Free</h2>\n<div class=\"db-credit-row db-credit-justify-content-center\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-col\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-text-center db-credit-mb-4\"><img style=\"width: 60px;\" alt=\"Add items to your basket\" title=\"Add items to your basket\" src=\"https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/resources.dividebuy.co.uk/credit-webpage/Shopping-Basket.png\">\n<h3 class=\"db-credit-mt-3 why-use-dividebuy\">Add items to your basket</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"db-credit-col\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-text-center db-credit-mb-4\"><img style=\"width: 60px;\" alt=\"Go to checkout and select DivideBuy\" title=\"Go to checkout and select DivideBuy\" src=\"https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/resources.dividebuy.co.uk/credit-webpage/icons.png\">\n<h3 class=\"db-credit-mt-3 why-use-dividebuy\">Go to checkout and select DivideBuy</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"db-credit-col\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-text-center db-credit-mb-4\"><img style=\"width: 60px;\" alt=\"Provide some personal details. If you are approved get instant credit decision\" title=\"Provide some personal details. If you are approved get instant credit decision\" src=\"https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/resources.dividebuy.co.uk/credit-webpage/My-Application.png\">\n<h3 class=\"db-credit-mt-3 why-use-dividebuy\">Provide some personal details. If you are approved, you'll get an instant credit decision</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"db-credit-col\">\n<div class=\"db-credit-text-center db-credit-mb-4\"><img style=\"width: 60px;\" alt=\"Pay first instalment\" title=\"Pay first instalment\" src=\"https://s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/resources.dividebuy.co.uk/credit-webpage/Pay-Now.png\">\n<h3 class=\"db-credit-mt-3 why-use-dividebuy\">Pay first instalment</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"db-credit-col\">\n<div 